  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1179258880
    m_Localized: Echo of Absorption
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1288310784
    m_Localized: After a successful absorption, gain 1 extra action once per turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351033
  - m_Id: 17556453552951296
    m_Localized: Initial Acceleration Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453620060160
    m_Localized: An untransformed Devorya [Pawn] can move forward 2 tiles on its
      first move in battle. Both tiles must be empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351034
  - m_Id: 17556453812998144
    m_Localized: Residual Thrust Controller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453812998145
    m_Localized: After absorbing an enemy piece, immediately gains 1 extra move.
      This extra move cannot be used to attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351035
  - m_Id: 17556453989158912
    m_Localized: Absorption Overcharger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17556453989158913
    m_Localized: After absorbing an enemy piece, maximum Energy increases by 1 during
      your next turn. The bonus expires at the end of that turn and does not stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1511529955060351036
